<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBN 120,000 tonnes Neptune Terminal/Kaohsiung 15-25/3 $7.40 fio 40,000 shinc/38,000 shinc China Steel.</p>
<p>Anthia - 65,000 tonnes Porto Bolivar/Wedel 14-28/2 $9.10 fio 35,000 shinc/15,000 shex Van Ommeren.</p>
<p>ORE - Docecape - 150,000 tonnes Tuburao/Rotterdam end Feb low $5.75/$6.00 fio seven days shinc Rohstoffhandel.</p>
<p>Rhodos - 11,000 tonnes Tuburao/Qingdao end Feb low $10.00s fio scale load/10,000 shinc Chinese charterers.</p>
</text>
